{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585660/extras/26561281e83d4ed782d33b93d0b28b8e.avif?t=1771616891\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PIRATE PILLAGE &amp; PLUNDER is the unique blend of\u00a0card game\u00a0and auto battler, wrapped together in a neat roguelike package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Traverse unique worlds</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585660/extras/03d171755d0e2bf81fdf2100478ac16a.avif?t=1771616891\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path through an <i>INFINITE</i> amount of procedurally generated environments</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle strange creatures</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overcome ever-insurmountable obstacles</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plunder this world, then the next (and the next, and the next, and the\u2026)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Build your army</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585660/extras/2fa15ce391b5360e445d1f44607078e5.avif?t=1771616891\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick the right allies to turn your army into an unstoppable force</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose tools which play to your armies strengths, or to cover their weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remove the dead-weight to keep your army at full strength</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your units or spells to bring out their full potential</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Command them in battle</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585660/extras/c838db7af2c6415a4141c4c37092005c.poster.avif?t=1771616891\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585660/extras/c838db7af2c6415a4141c4c37092005c.webm?t=1771616891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your units and support them as they cross the battlefield. Their survival is up to you!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your units and watch them move!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support them with powerful spells to help them cross the battlefield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the opposing armies commander to continue your conquest</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Collect Booty</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585660/extras/078d9a69fa4c4dde0c0ae04821c1f4b8.avif?t=1771616891\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alter your army with powerful trinkets which will (<i>mostly</i>) prove useful in battles to come</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack multiple trinkets together to turn the tides of battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be wary with what you collect\u2026 a cursed trinket may be more trouble than it\u2019s worth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new trinkets throughout your adventures to support future armies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Do it all AGAIN</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Millions</i> of outcomes with no two adventures the same!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Allies have unique effects which change every time you meet\u2026</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies grow with you, collecting their own trinkets to put a stop to your reign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two playthroughs are ever the same! (Unless you use the same seed)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featuring:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nine</strong> different factions to take control of. Each with their own unique playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>200+</strong> Handcrafted cards with beautiful artworks, 1000+ different effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+</strong> Trinkets to stack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30+</strong> Unique challenges to overcome</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+</strong> Enemies looking to put an end to your adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>Infinite</strong></i></u> Plunder to Pillage</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585660?t=1771616891","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585660?t=1771616891","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585660/3e42310510f746afee40d7bef95d682cf029ddfd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771616891","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585660/3e42310510f746afee40d7bef95d682cf029ddfd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771616891","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":438117